Phase 10 — Authentication & Multi-User Enablement
================================================================================

Decisions:
- Provider: Auth.js v5 (next-auth@5) + @auth/prisma-adapter
- Sessions: Database sessions in PostgreSQL (not JWT-only) — instant revocation, works on serverless
- Login methods: Google OAuth (primary button) + Email magic link via Resend (secondary, expandable)
- Multi-tenant: Single workspace per user at launch, auto-created on signup. Schema already supports multi-workspace for later.
- Roles: owner/viewer only at launch. WorkspaceMember.role field supports more values later.
- Future SSO: ORCID (OAuth2, easy add), Institutional SAML via BoxyHQ SAML Jackson when needed
- Core principle: ServiceScope remains the internal contract — just populate from real session instead of SINGLE_USER_SCOPE

